---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Animation from '../../components/animations/AIAutomationAnimation.astro';
---
<Base title="AI & Automation | ITKeepers" description="Explore a sample request workflow with a person reviewing the draft.">
<section class="section service-page-example"><p class="eyebrow">Core IT operations</p><h1>AI &amp; Automation</h1><p class="lead">Explore a sample request workflow with a person reviewing the draft.</p><Animation /><div class="offering-detail" id="ai-automation-details" aria-labelledby="ai-governance-title">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">AI governance</p>
            <h3 id="ai-governance-title">Use AI. Without the new risk.</h3>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>This is the aim of a considered approach to AI, not a promise of risk-free use. Define permitted uses, decide who can access information and keep human review where it matters.</p>
            <p>A useful starting point is one repeatable task: what goes in, what should come out and who checks the result. Agree the scope and suitable controls before introducing a workflow.</p>
            <a class="scene-link" href="/contact">Talk to our team</a>
          </div>
        </div></section>
<section class="cta"><h2>Bring the context. We'll start there.</h2><p>Tell us what you are managing today and what needs attention.</p><a class="btn white" href="/contact">Talk to our team</a></section>
</Base>
